  "description": "Ugreen 9-in-1 USB C Docking Station Must Read: The Displaylink software must be installed to ensure media display and network RJ45 functionality can be used correctly.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Ugreen 9-in-1 USB C Docking Station </h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-1_3e1a5203-0992-43d2-8fde-aa11b55d1850.png?v=1675907215\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-1_3e1a5203-0992-43d2-8fde-aa11b55d1850.png?v=1675907215\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p><strong>Must Read: The Displaylink software must be installed to ensure media display and network RJ45 functionality can be used correctly.</strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/A__6.png?v=1677148992\"></div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-7_e9bdf4d5-5544-4a2a-acdf-0a84125ab355.jpg?v=1675907214\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-7_e9bdf4d5-5544-4a2a-acdf-0a84125ab355.jpg?v=1675907214\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-3_7f3c2625-20ad-4a16-8284-5ee16d7064d5.jpg?v=1675907215\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-3_7f3c2625-20ad-4a16-8284-5ee16d7064d5.jpg?v=1675907215\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-4_36bf6a63-fc87-434a-8200-5b9d1c3d0d57.jpg?v=1675907215\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-4_36bf6a63-fc87-434a-8200-5b9d1c3d0d57.jpg?v=1675907215\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-2_7a2501ec-5360-444b-ab28-d35efaed0f85.jpg?v=1675907215\" data-mce-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-2_7a2501ec-5360-444b-ab28-d35efaed0f85.jpg?v=1675907215\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0257/5246/9566/files/Detail-8_51368d50-7052-4370-b01b-325d1aeee342.jpg?v=1675907214\" data-mce-src=\"https